"bb_tag\" >WOOD</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081000/extras/66a135112e8ecfd5da398aff4af0de4e.poster.avif?t=1754803769\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081000/extras/66a135112e8ecfd5da398aff4af0de4e.webm?t=1754803769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081000/extras/66a135112e8ecfd5da398aff4af0de4e.mp4?t=1754803769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Sticks and twigs can be found all around the map, but timber for structures needs to be cut down. This requires an axe and a wedge for quartering logs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DECISION</h2> Stay and survive or find your way back to civilization.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Full year season rotation<br></li><li>Progression of skills<br></li><li>Large variety of different items<br></li><li>Customizable difficulty settings<br></li><li>Different animals and biomes</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Bushcraft and survive on a deserted island where nature is both your greatest ally and fiercest adversary. As the weather turns colder toward winter, preparation becomes key to survival. Build shelters, hunt, fish, farm, and craft items from natural resources\u2014all without any modern tools.",
